'''Alex '''is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[Codes|code]] "AL3X". It is now only obtainable through trading as the code has since expired.

== Appearance ==
Alex knife has a purple-pink gradient blade with a teal, sparkly area in the center. In the center is a representation of his original logo, a husky. The blade also consists of little teal triangles around the center. It has a purple guard with a black handle.

== Trivia ==
* This is 1 of 5 youtuber code knives. The others being [[Corl]], [[Sketchy]], [[Denis]] and [[Sub]], not including [[JD]], a very special [[Legendary Weapons|Legendary]] knife.
*Like every other [[Codes|code]], this [[Codes|code]] has already expired.

